n's plans  well as i'm sure you can imagine this is  a controversial decision and a lot of  scientific experts have been keen to  stress some of the pros some of the  reasons that this might be the right  time and of course the risks that are  involved as well scientific experts  pointing to the fact that we are now two  years into this virus there is this wall  as it's being called  of immunity that is uh in place but  good deal of concern as well while it's  known that the omicron variant which is  now the most dominant here uh is milder  it is that does not mean that it's not  still extremely dangerous particularly  for the most vulnerable so there are  those risks some of the prime minister's  fiercest critics as well might accuse  him of announcing this now as a way of  shoring up support within his own party  he has been under a lot of pressure  yesterday and as i said this is  something that will be politically quite  popular for him for his supporters but  for those who are clinically vulnerable  this is a very concerning time a lot of  people will be looking extremely closely  at the data and the effect that this has  on hospitalization numbers some  scientific experts saying that they  really need to see the data that's  driven this decision  charlotte chelsea pill in london many  thanks
 

